# Line-ending policy: pin LF in the repository and in the working tree so a
# diff is always about the change and never about the line endings.
# core.autocrlf is true on the authoring machine. Binaries are marked
# binary so autocrlf never rewrites them: a CRLF rewrite is a silent
# corruption of a PDF stream.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
